@startuml dsp-delivery
skinparam dpi 150
title Delivery speed: from the push to prod (new steps in bold)

participant "Owner session" as W
participant "Gateway" as G
participant "GitHub\nPR + merge queue" as Q
participant "Actions\nBuild / Release" as A
participant "Octopus" as O
participant "tdd / uat / prod" as E

W -> Q : push head H, open PR
Q -> A : Build on H (push)
W -> W : **Functional Testing on H at once (verdict + video)**
note right of W : CI and FT run side by side;\nboth must hold for the same H
A --> G : checks green on H
W -> G : PASS on H
G -> Q : **enqueue H (expected head H, squash; only non-failing PRs merge)**
Q -> A : **Build on the merge group (H on top of master and the PRs ahead)**
A --> Q : **group green**
Q -> Q : **master normally moves to the tested commit C**
Q -> A : Build on master C
A -> A : **a group run with head exactly C exists: carry its packages and build-version, skip the rebuild**\n(otherwise the full build runs)
A -> O : Release workflow: release R(C), **version from build-version**
O -> E : deploy R to tdd (with its acceptance tests)
G -> G : settle: R carries C, item in Release Queue
G -> E : Healthy read, /_build = R, **settle 2 min**
G -> G : **train: newest qualifying release for uat is R (older ones superseded)**
G -> O : create deployment R to uat; answer Sign-off
O -> E : deploy R to uat
G -> O : **Smoke test runbook on uat for R (during the settle)**
O --> G : **smoke PASS**
G -> E : Healthy reads, settle 10 min (unchanged)
G -> O : create deployment R to prod; answer Sign-off
O -> E : deploy R to prod
G -> G : every item in R: Done
@enduml
